**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# Excluded to keep it out of the image, and because `az acr build` dies packing the
# source tar when it cannot read it: "[WinError 5] Access is denied: '.\.pytest_cache'".
# pytest leaves directories here that the CLI has no rights to open, and the failure
# looked like a successful deploy — the build never queued, the previous image rolled
# out instead, and the version on the VM did not change.
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.git
.nsdeploy
cailville
docs
tests
nsdeploy_service/tests
nsdeploy_service/nsdeploy_service.egg-info
*.egg-info
# .env is deliberately NOT excluded. This image is private and has no other
# credential channel, so the file has to ship; envfile.py reads either the root copy
# or nsdeploy_service/.env. The cost is that the key lives in an image layer and
# stays recoverable from layer history even if a later layer removes it — so if this
# image ever reaches a shared registry, rotate the key and move to container env
# vars or NSDEPLOY_SERVICE_ENV_FILE on a mounted volume.
.DS_Store
